			"widgets_values":[
				"女主@image1站在咖啡店招牌旁叉腰定格，随后放下手，自然缓步走向镜头。\nCinematic full-body shot. A stylish East Asian girl stands confidently with one hand on hip in front of a rustic wooden \"COFFEE N MUSIC\" signboard. Behind her is a historic European stone building with an arched doorway and a vibrant blue shopfront. Bright morning sunlight, soft shadows on cobblestone street. She drops her hand and begins to walk slowly toward the camera with a gentle smile, natural swaying movement. Shot on 35mm lens, shallow depth of field, 8k, photorealistic, street fashion photography style, smooth slow motion.\n\n女主@image1手持一杯冰咖啡，沿着人行道自然行走，看向镜头并微笑，背景为石砌建筑。\nMedium-full tracking shot. The girl walks naturally along a sunlit European sidewalk, holding an iced coffee cup with straw in her right hand. Historic stone buildings with arched doorways and blue painted storefronts in background. She glances at the camera with a sweet, confident smile. Warm golden hour sunlight, dappled shadows on the ground. Cinematic color grading, street style fashion film aesthetic, fluid camera movement following her pace, highly detailed fabric texture on lace top, 8k realistic.\n\n女主@image1停在石拱门前，单手持咖啡，仰头看向建筑上方，嘴角带笑，背景有路人模糊走过。\nCinematic medium shot. The girl stands still beside an ancient stone archway, holding her coffee cup, looking upward at the building with a dreamy, happy expression. Pedestrians walk blurred in the background. Strong sunlight creates sharp architectural shadows on the stone wall. She wears brown buckle boots and pleated skirt. European street photography composition, natural lighting, realistic skin texture, film grain, moment of pause and appreciation.\n\n快速转场，女主@image1从蓝色咖啡店门前走来，随后切换到繁忙街道中行走，背景有行人和车辆。\nQuick transition shot. The girl walks toward camera passing a vivid blue vintage shopfront with glass windows reflecting sunlight. She holds her iced coffee, looking down slightly then lifting her gaze to camera with a subtle smile. Cobblestone pavement, European architectural details, cinematic motion blur background, realistic street atmosphere, 8k.\nWide tracking shot following the girl from front. She walks down a lively European city street lined with trees and classic buildings. Background shows pedestrians, parked cars, and green summer foliage. She holds coffee in right hand, bag strap across shoulder, walking with relaxed confidence. Bright daylight, high dynamic range, realistic urban ambience, fashion vlog style.\n\n场景切换至红砖建筑前，女主@image1侧头看向画面右侧，阳光在发丝和咖啡杯上形成高光。\nMedium close-up shot. The girl stands in front of a modern brick building with black glass doors, holding her coffee cup. She turns her head to the side looking off-camera right, sunlight catching her hair and the rim of the cup. Warm color palette, sharp focus on her outfit details (pink lace, brown pleats), soft bokeh background. Fashion editorial style, golden sunlight, cinematic composition.\n\n女主@image1在石砌建筑旁行走，手持咖啡，抬头仰望天空或建筑，步伐轻盈。\nSide-angle tracking shot. The girl walks past a textured stone wall and dark arched doorway, holding coffee in her right hand. She looks upward while walking, expression curious and joyful. Blue vintage storefront visible in background. Natural sunlight illuminates her figure from the side, creating soft shadows on the ground. Realistic fabric movement on skirt and top, cinematic street photography, smooth continuous motion.\n\n女主@image1在蓝色咖啡店门前停步，双手捧住咖啡杯，直视镜头，画面定格。\nCinematic medium shot. The girl stops in front of the blue shopfront, holding the coffee cup with both hands at chest level. She looks directly into the camera with a calm, gentle expression. Bright daylight fills the frame, sharp details on the lace trim of her pink top and the brown pleated skirt. Clean composition, shallow depth of field blurring the blue storefront behind her. Perfect ending frame for fashion film, 8k photorealistic, highly detailed.",
